{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43283","headline":"洛出书 · 叔孙玄观","name":"洛出书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清洛含温溜，玄龟荐宝书。\n波开绿字出，瑞应紫宸居。\n物着羣灵首，文成列卦初。\n美珍翔阁凤，庆迈跃舟鱼。\n俾姒惟何远，休皇复在诸。\n东都主人意，歌颂望乘舆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"叔孙玄观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}